%% render.orientation: landscape
flowchart LR
  Scheduler[Sidekiq scheduler] -->|every 15 min| Gate{Weather.enabled?<br/>switch on and an enabled<br/>source with an enabled location}
  Scheduler -->|daily 06:30| Gate
  Gate -->|no| Skip[Enqueue aborted, queued jobs return at once]
  Gate -->|yes| RefreshScan[RefreshScanJob]
  Gate -->|yes| BackfillScan[BackfillScanJob]
  RefreshScan -->|staggered 2 s| RefreshLoc[RefreshLocationJob]
  RefreshLoc --> Adapter[Adapter fetch_snapshot]
  Adapter -->|citypage XML| Store[(current, forecasts, hourly live_feed observation)]
  Adapter -->|always on success| Stamp[last_refreshed_at; current and forecast stamps only when present]
  BackfillScan --> BackfillLoc[BackfillLocationJob]
  BackfillLoc --> History[Adapter fetch_observations]
  History -->|climate-hourly, climate-daily| Gaps{missing or null?}
  Gaps -->|create or fill only| Store
  Store --> Pages[Settlement pages and charts read stored rows only, fragment cached]
  Scheduler -->|daily 04:45| PurgeGate{readings stored?}
  PurgeGate -->|yes| Purge[PurgeJob retention]
  Purge --> Store
